  "term": "absolute reality",
  "definition": "Absolute reality refers to an ultimate unity in which the knower and what is known are not separate, but form one whole. In this historical usage, it means the total reality that includes the universe and human thought and action, especially as the source of what is most universal and valuable in human experience.",
